{"ticker":"META","updated":"2026-10-30T22:58:50Z","profile":{"longName":"Meta Platforms, Inc.","shortName":"Meta Platforms, Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","country":"United States","website":"https://www.meta.com","fullTimeEmployees":66775,"marketCap":1572426743808,"trailingPE":20.982258,"forwardPE":17.2809,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.508254,"pegRatio":0.82,"targetMeanPrice":848.3765,"targetHighPrice":1050.0,"targetLowPrice":629.06,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":58,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.261,"earningsGrowth":2.648,"grossMargins":0.81034,"operatingMargins":0.35414,"profitMargins":0.31145,"totalRevenue":241605001216,"beta":1.185,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":779.82,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":520.26,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.34},"summary":"Meta Platforms, Inc. engages in the development of products that enable people to connect and share with friends and family through mobile devices, personal computers, virtual reality (VR) headsets, and AI glasses in the United States, Canada, Europe, Asia-Pacific, and internationally. It operates through two segments, Family of Apps (FoA) and Reality Labs (RL). The FoA segment offers Facebook, which enables people to build community through feed, reels, stories, groups, marketplace, and other; Instagram that brings people closer through Instagram feed, stories, reels, live, and messaging; Messenger, a messaging application for people to connect with friends, family, communities, and businesses across platforms and devices through text, audio, and video calls; Meta AI, an assistant that's available across apps, as a stand-alone app, on AI glasses, and on the web; Threads, an application for text-based updates and public conversations; and WhatsApp, a messaging application that is used by people and businesses to communicate and transact. The RL segment provides virtual and augmented reality products, including consumer hardware, software, and content that help people feel connected, as well as Meta Quest devices that enable social experiences across gaming, fitness, entertainment, and more. The segment also includes wearables such as AI glasses like Ray Ban Meta and Oakley Meta","summary_zh":"Meta Platforms, Inc. 致力於開發產品，使人們能夠在美國、加拿大、歐洲、亞太地區和國際上透過行動裝置、個人電腦、虛擬實境 (VR) 耳機和人工智慧眼鏡與朋友和家人聯繫和分享。它透過兩個部門運作：應用程式家族 (FoA) 和現實實驗室 (RL)。 FoA 部分提供 Facebook，它使人們能夠透過提要、捲軸、故事、群組、市場等建立社區； Instagram 透過 Instagram 動態、故事、視訊、直播和訊息傳遞拉近人們的距離； Messenger，一種訊息應用程序，供人們透過文字、音訊和視訊通話使用裝置與朋友、家人、社群和企業聯絡； Meta、識別Threads，一個基於文字的更新和公開對話的應用程式； WhatsApp，一個供個人和企業用來溝通和交易的訊息應用程式。 RL 部門提供虛擬和擴增實境產品，包括幫助人們感受到連結的消費者硬體、軟體和內容，以及支援遊戲、健身、娛樂等社交體驗的 Meta Quest 裝置。該細分市場還包括可穿戴設備，例如 Ray Ban Meta 和 Oakley Meta 等 AI 眼鏡","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"網路內容與資訊","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":726.04,"h":736.0,"l":721.73,"c":735.11,"v":9350900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":736.0,"h":740.25,"l":733.99,"c":737.05,"v":7699300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":748.57,"h":761.16,"l":745.82,"c":748.65,"v":11439100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":752.62,"h":757.95,"l":745.03,"c":752.45,"v":9663400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":756.0,"h":766.51,"l":752.02,"c":752.3,"v":13087800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":757.49,"h":766.3,"l":753.43,"c":765.7,"v":10999000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":765.13,"h":765.7,"l":751.0,"c":751.98,"v":12478300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":754.65,"h":757.1,"l":748.37,"c":750.9,"v":7923300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":748.73,"h":757.57,"l":743.76,"c":755.59,"v":8248600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":757.47,"h":774.07,"l":751.99,"c":764.7,"v":10533800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":767.0,"h":781.36,"l":765.1,"c":779.0,"v":11782500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":779.99,"h":783.29,"l":766.31,"c":775.72,"v":9400900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":780.75,"h":788.78,"l":773.36,"c":780.25,"v":10955000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":786.42,"h":790.8,"l":769.19,"c":778.38,"v":23696800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":781.85,"h":785.73,"l":764.47,"c":765.16,"v":11706900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":769.25,"h":770.6,"l":751.07,"c":755.4,"v":10872600},{"t":